## Secure Drop – DevOps & Backend Challenge

### Live URL
https://secure-drop.example.com

### Summary
This PR implements a production-ready "Secure Drop" service using Laravel 11,
following a strict Service–Repository architecture. Secrets are encrypted at rest,
burned on read, and exposed via UUID-based URLs.

### Architecture
- Laravel 11 API
- Service–Repository pattern
- Encrypted payloads
- UUID identifiers
- TTL-based expiration

### DevOps
- Multi-stage Docker build
- Non-root container execution
- Traefik reverse proxy using Docker labels
- Health checks
- Environment-specific Docker Compose files

